"size":21152,"digest":null,"download_count":82,"created_at":"2025-05-13T14:55:20Z","updated_at":"2025-05-13T14:55:20Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/pallets/flask/releases/download/3.1.1/multiple.intoto.jsonl"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pallets/flask/tarball/3.1.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pallets/flask/zipball/3.1.1","body":"This is the Flask 3.1.1 fix release, which fixes bugs but does not otherwise change behavior and should not result in breaking changes compared to the latest feature release.\r\n\r\nPyPI: https://pypi.org/project/Flask/3.1.1/\r\nChanges: https://flask.palletsprojects.com/en/stable/changes/#version-3-1-1\r\nMilestone https://github.com/pallets/flask/milestone/36?closed=1\r\n\r\n- Fix signing key selection order when key rotation is enabled via `SECRET_KEY_FALLBACKS`. GHSA-4grg-w6v8-c28g\r\n- Fix type hint for `cli_runner.invoke`. #5645\r\n- `flask --help` loads the app and plugins first to make sure all commands are shown. #5673\r\n- Mark sans-io base class as being able to handle views that return `AsyncIterable`. This is not accurate for Flask, but makes typing easier for Quart. #5659","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pallets/flask/releases/218299378/reactions","total_count":37,"+1":20,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":5,"confused":0,"heart":7,"rocket":5,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pallets/flask/releases/185264271","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pallets/flask/releases/185264271/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/pallets/flask/releases/185264271/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/pallets/flask/releases/tag/3.1.0","id":185264271,"author":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_ur